<description>&lt;p&gt;The Colombian army carried out an air strike that killed senior Gulf Clan leaders and several members, while cocaine-linked militias employed Ukraine-style drones in attacks that killed four soldiers. Venezuela and Colombia launched a joint border security operation after a series of kidnappings. A grenade blast hit RCN's Cali offices, targeting journalists. Five former soldiers were sentenced for killing civilians and for executions, and a Colombian accused by the United States of trafficking cocaine and supporting FARC dissidents remains under investigation. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOQnAyWXczaWpFRWw0MVFrVUVCbWtEV1FmZGFzZ0VCT19EMzZXM1ZMZDVOMjJ2dFhMdGtNY3ExOGt3WlRMQ3BOMVkwOFAyQzdyV0NCdHgwR2I2aG8tY2tMX3NNOWlXZl80MEdTcmRWZDVrcHRjTFlDYzJhV2ZrdjQ2Q3RURUlXbTI0Z1RkSGVGaXp1b1ZnNHI2SEhDZk9FNnR5QV9SYnhjbEVlZTlhYm11b1hKQWJaTXBVaVdYckxB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPcjFQM3Z1RUNQdmtuXzRvWWJWZ3NldjRJdkFQSVctQXBRSm5OR2VwTGF3aHZDRjlDU0RvUzY4d0RURk80bzZTZUpRcl9ob2I4UGVfaFRaTjZ6YUVHcUFfaU5fOV9GbWNqRHllN2NfdDJxTmoydXVlZ0JsbUdjbHN6cldJOEh0YjY5Q0VLT0NoTHNBb0FlRklnNDAwNHd6amVLYnBYanlkZ3FobjNZdkluekJoQWhadEhGNlZr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1MZGNnQ3BCTkhTdjUtTWxTWXh6Z3A3ekZSZ19jX1MzSWhVcVEtNmpWV3J3bThLNXhrNGJoa1hTQXBJYmVfWHRpQmtBbjdKTmhTN3VHM0NKUjJnSVpnSHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPTUZsRWhYbFRFNUY1SFYya3hLb2w3bHRjck5UVmRoMGprQU9JR3BCMjVyWW55N2VyUzJ6M1hOLUVaMll5S0FQTmJqcHZZSm5sNXdNVk1yYWo5Tm5QY1hKUzNuSzJvcjk5UlJmNWduRjI2cXdaUE1VSVRtdU5ldFJ5ZVU0aEJzM2JDRXUwdlJ5X0h4S1NTZzJ1eGxUMW5qSTFzY3FYT0t2S0tlM